    "title": "Donut chart",
    "use": "Show a whole divided into a few clearly labeled parts.",
    "markup": "<div class=\"diagram-scroll\"><svg class=\"diagram-canvas\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 180\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"90\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--a12)\" stroke-width=\"24\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"90\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"24\" stroke-dasharray=\"171.5 155.2\" transform=\"rotate(-90 98 90)\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"90\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--a40)\" stroke-width=\"24\" stroke-dasharray=\"98 228.7\" stroke-dashoffset=\"-171.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 98 90)\"/>\n        <text class=\"diagram-value\" x=\"98\" y=\"94\">core 52%</text>\n        <rect x=\"182\" y=\"46\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--accent)\"/><text class=\"diagram-label is-small\" x=\"240\" y=\"52\">core · 52%</text>\n        <rect x=\"182\" y=\"82\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--a40)\"/><text class=\"diagram-label is-small\" x=\"240\" y=\"88\">support · 30%</text>\n        <rect x=\"182\" y=\"118\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--a12)\"/><text class=\"diagram-label is-small\" x=\"240\" y=\"124\">other · 18%</text>\n      </svg></div>\n      <figcaption class=\"diagram-summary\">Core work accounts for 52% of the supplied total, followed by support at 30%.</figcaption>"
