    "title": "Class",
    "use": "Types, their fields and methods, and inheritance.",
    "markup": "<div class=\"diagram-scroll\"><svg class=\"diagram-canvas\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 220\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <defs><marker id=\"class-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 5 10 0 10 10Z\" fill=\"var(--background)\" stroke=\"var(--a40)\"/></marker></defs>\n        <rect class=\"diagram-node is-focal\" x=\"104\" y=\"14\" width=\"112\" height=\"76\" rx=\"4\"/><line class=\"diagram-gridline\" x1=\"104\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"42\"/><line class=\"diagram-gridline\" x1=\"104\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"66\"/><text class=\"diagram-label\" x=\"160\" y=\"28\">Artifact</text><text class=\"diagram-label is-small\" x=\"160\" y=\"54\">title: string</text><text class=\"diagram-label is-small\" x=\"160\" y=\"78\">render()</text>\n        <rect class=\"diagram-node\" x=\"24\" y=\"138\" width=\"112\" height=\"62\" rx=\"4\"/><line class=\"diagram-gridline\" x1=\"24\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"136\" y2=\"166\"/><text class=\"diagram-label\" x=\"80\" y=\"152\">Page</text><text class=\"diagram-label is-small\" x=\"80\" y=\"182\">layout: width</text>\n        <rect class=\"diagram-node\" x=\"184\" y=\"138\" width=\"112\" height=\"62\" rx=\"4\"/><line class=\"diagram-gridline\" x1=\"184\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"166\"/><text class=\"diagram-label\" x=\"240\" y=\"152\">Fragment</text><text class=\"diagram-label is-small\" x=\"240\" y=\"182\">scope: host</text>\n        <path class=\"diagram-edge\" d=\"M80 138V114H144V94\" marker-end=\"url(#class-arrow)\"/><path class=\"diagram-edge\" d=\"M240 138V114H176V94\" marker-end=\"url(#class-arrow)\"/>\n      </svg></div>\n      <figcaption class=\"diagram-summary\">Page and Fragment inherit the shared Artifact contract while adding their own fields.</figcaption>"
  },
  {
